# README media: KIPPER. The GIF is the title's own demo: the demo player
# swims Kipper home through the Kelpwood towing three finds. The rest set a
# scene with cheats and play it for a moment.
shotscale 2
seed 22
game kipper
wait 60
shot kipper_title
wait 850
gifstart kipper 3 1
wait 720
gifstop
# a dock's equipment screen
game kipper
wait 10
press A
wait 40
press A
wait 10
cheat god
cheat have 0
cheat have 2
cheat have 4
cheat have 6
cheat have 9
cheat fit 6
cheat fit 0
cheat lights 2
cheat tanks 9
cheat boosters 7
cheat eggsback 6
cheat tile 80 5
hold UP 60
wait 10
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press DOWN
wait 30
shot kipper_dock
press B
wait 10
# Inkwell reaches out of the wall in the Coral Garden
cheat calm
cheat tile 122 22
cheat bosspos 1 2040 360
cheat stormy
wait 200
shot kipper_inkwell
# Auntie Roe
cheat calm
cheat take 52
cheat take 53
cheat tile 60 9
hold LEFT 30
wait 30
shot kipper_roe
press A
wait 30
# the Blackwater by lamplight
cheat tile 58 116
wait 150
shot kipper_blackwater
# Xolloth's laser
cheat openall
cheat stormy
cheat tile 76 141
wait 2
cheat bosst 5 100
wait 40
shot kipper_xolloth
